    "body": "Hi!\r\n\r\nI'm also facing this issue. Any typed character on multiline input just disappears. This is the line that causes this:\r\nhttps://github.com/starship/starship/blob/4ee6e6ce3fb75e59addb999eaf90368506dfc215/src/print.rs#L79\r\n\r\nIt was added in https://github.com/starship/starship/pull/739. \r\n\r\n@chipbuster the author of this issue has deleted their account. I'd like to ask if this workaround is still required? \r\n\r\n",
