    "updated_at": "2022-02-08T16:14:05Z",
    "body": "Ah, sorry. This got buried beneath the pile of notifications I get from this project x)\r\n\r\nFish shell has made quite a few improvements and fixes since that PR was made. If someone would like to test it, it should be pretty simple to see if it's still needed: just open up fish shell, start starship, `cd` into a directory with a long path one directory at a time, then use Alt+Left to backtrack and see if the directory name is appropriately shortened.",
